<title>USA: LIPA schedules final hearing on Lilco takeover.</title>
<headline>LIPA schedules final hearing on Lilco takeover.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Long Island Power Authority (LIPA) announced that it will hold one additional public hearing on its plan to acquire Long Island Lighting Co.</p>
<p>The hearing will be held June 3 from 7:30 p.m. to 11:00 p.m. at Hofstra University Student Center Theater, North Campus, Hempstead, N.Y.</p>
<p>Public comments on the takeover will be accepted at the meeting.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
